55d5965fd0352ea6c44a095d1351c49752b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/extension-template/git/trees/bda855d5965fd0352ea6c44a095d1351c49752b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/extension-template/git/commits/503f00d716d7583b6d8c48ad670bab86e4a83072","verification":{"payload":"tree bda855d5965fd0352ea6c44a095d1351c49752b2\nparent 7a5db4991890f3f7173b0862f08fbf0598185cec\nauthor vidartf-jpmc <104149412+vidartf-jpmc@users.noreply.github.com> 1784194887 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784194887 +0100\n\nUpdate pyproject license spec to follow PEP639 (#150)\n\n* Update pyproject license spec\n\nThe old table with file/text is deprecated, see PEP639.\r\nNow uses \"license-files\" for files to include in dist,\r\nand \"license\" field is an SPDX identifier.\r\n\r\nThis should also make programmatic license identification\r\nto be much easier.\n\n* Remove pypi trove license classifier\n\nAccording to PEP639 it is now deprecated ( https://peps.python.org/pep-0639/#deprecate-license-classifiers )","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWKdHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUycQAKyvhfx8I+7YnACZ3Ly1QEWL\nUQrkNU+82blw6EnT7UowYPfdwNu0gT1uRrmw325jaRKWpkrB1bAsi7gnqGeR3eMv\nDyiG9FMwzfQ4OlN8qMUyWOLx9MKoYYb6gFv6x0bGvUJuCzsHpCbv02eWm/pq3O+0\niam79dq3I5qCuoyBACb5mXz29nvS3jHggHDu3xbDEfq0xe6q53sQYEh8P9bR74iP\nWPzt7Smnx3Yq6Qnz2haUvcqCtptx7h0TCIgI/p/m6UaCWu1ZkRs9fIKRdjie/RpL\nMEFTl9GLea6atJBIHn0uBIvQsa6EjRl13BeUCmeTmvKJbfg5Wy04EkoU6E1srEu6\njyhs/nizogSzU5ftigvVzmA2YosPj6FrMQh9ECpi+0ld/CMjK0aobUwS+PwPj8Ny\nbFXPhq3RJ10H1RiF/U4q2qzsVejISHNr9XRShjEKpSRO0dUyU2Jhasb1davFLMTF\nDpJhz+03v1grA69in+QS9WmRRvoRu2bXo/b2yHVLuUd971GY582onXM+dYOs3c95\nve8H5gsnHLBx8XN3GutsMauQ+WikFOJa+l2M7zw7ZA9mdy8Ilz3gtiowDDTeD6Kl\nD6gJjStKESfx64BDF5Smzuq++Ex1lJ/XTNCS4jpIyUgiR6GjRLonOW6wObpbrc90\nMGi9DaFHqn7OwPSUrZaB\n=Z2Cg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T09:41:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuse