6VXNlcjExNDEzNzk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/commits/527412e77694fa5438f22e55617d2607b6388c7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T19:19:51Z","email":"jonathan@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan Stevens"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T19:19:51Z","email":"jonathan@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan Stevens"},"message":"Enhance database and cluster tooling integration\n\n- Added new dependencies for `drizzle-orm` and `typeid-js` to improve database handling capabilities.\n- Updated `pnpm-lock.yaml` to reflect the addition of new packages and their versions, ensuring compatibility with the latest features.\n- Modified `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to include `packages/databases/*`, enhancing project organization and allowing for better management of database-related packages.\n- Updated `README.adoc` to clarify environment variable usage for database connections and backend registrations.\n- Refactored `tsconfig.base.json` to include paths for the new database packages, improving module resolution.\n- Introduced new CRUD handlers and RPC helpers in the core package to streamline entity management and enhance functionality.\n\nThis commit improves the overall architecture and usability of the database and cluster tooling features, facilitating better development practices.","tree":{"sha":"0fd3428f95e4f67f41750c28929c25d4e9eb707a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/0fd3428f95e4f67f41750c28929c25d4e9eb707a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/527412e77694fa5438f22e55617d2607b6388c7f","verification":{"payload":"tree 0fd3428f95e4f67f41750c28929c25d4e9eb707a\nparent 6d00bde8ca99b317407c6f5f9cb12442df82b31c\nauthor Jonathan Stevens <jonathan@resnovas.com> 1776021591 +0100\ncommitter Jonathan Stevens <jonathan@resnovas.com> 1776021591 +0100\n\nEnhance database and cluster tooling integration\n\n- Added new dependencies for `drizzle-orm` and `typeid-js` to improve database handling capabilities.\n- Updated `pnpm-lock.yaml` to reflect the addition of new packages and their versions, ensuring compatibility with the latest features.\n- Modified `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to include `packages/databases/*`, enhancing project organization and allowing for better management of database-related packages.\n- Updated `README.adoc` to clarify environment variable usage for database connections and backend registrations.\n- Refactored `tsconfig.base.json` to include paths for the new database packages, improving module resolution.\n- Introduced new CRUD handlers and RPC helpers in the core package to streamline entity management and enhance functionality.\n\nThis commit improves the overall architecture and usability of the database and cluster tooling features, facilitating better development practices.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOw2R1GUopWyn4HFyGzaJLu85cn\nNLOl6UK81riqa0nIoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDRyc5+FOPQjt1b5iUTgVQqs0VRWsXL4jGE4UONKhcJMxsrV+5DtvBdX1cNh2pfgdv\nT+OPVPjN5J3qJQxWKFRw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-12T19:21:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11413796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/