er}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/commits/6d00bde8ca99b317407c6f5f9cb12442df82b31c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T19:51:41Z","email":"jonathan@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan Stevens"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T19:51:41Z","email":"jonathan@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan Stevens"},"message":"Add new agent definitions for Accessibility Auditor, Account Strategist, Accounts Payable Agent, Ad Creative Strategist, Agentic Identity & Trust Architect, Agents Orchestrator, and AI Citation Strategist\n\n- Introduced new agent files defining roles, responsibilities, and workflows for various specialized functions including accessibility auditing, account strategy, payment processing, ad creative strategy, identity and trust architecture, workflow orchestration, and AI citation optimization.\n- Each agent includes detailed descriptions, core missions, critical rules, and technical deliverables to enhance the overall functionality and usability of the system.\n- This commit expands the capabilities of the platform by integrating diverse expertise areas, facilitating better automation and efficiency in operations.","tree":{"sha":"187ab4288415dfc29b305498206546f356fef16a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/187ab4288415dfc29b305498206546f356fef16a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/6d00bde8ca99b317407c6f5f9cb12442df82b31c","verification":{"payload":"tree 187ab4288415dfc29b305498206546f356fef16a\nparent 2b63dd6c5eab67996dc0dedea9b68f07e12c1e13\nauthor Jonathan Stevens <jonathan@resnovas.com> 1775677901 +0100\ncommitter Jonathan Stevens <jonathan@resnovas.com> 1775677901 +0100\n\nAdd new agent definitions for Accessibility Auditor, Account Strategist, Accounts Payable Agent, Ad Creative Strategist, Agentic Identity & Trust Architect, Agents Orchestrator, and AI Citation Strategist\n\n- Introduced new agent files defining roles, responsibilities, and workflows for various specialized functions including accessibility auditing, account strategy, payment processing, ad creative strategy, identity and trust architecture, workflow orchestration, and AI citation optimization.\n- Each agent includes detailed descriptions, core missions, critical rules, and technical deliverables to enhance the overall functionality and usability of the system.\n- This commit expands the capabilities of the platform by integrating diverse expertise areas, facilitating better automation and efficiency in operations.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOw2R1GUopWyn4HFyGzaJLu85cn\nNLOl6UK81riqa0nIoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEcd3Bwp0lexlpNo+3dIdVh+59yuafRQjTQrbfpbNOt5KEejQQvH8DA3cKfFDAga1a\nhbcvnomppY4kDTauYpbQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-08T19:51:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11413796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TGTGamer","id":11413796,"login":"TGTGamer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDEzNzk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://ap