uster platform\n\n- Introduced new functions for managing application layers, including `collectColocatedShooterPrograms` and `mergeApplicationLayerVariants`, to streamline the integration of application layers in the cluster platform.\n- Updated the `createClusterDatabasePlatform` function to utilize the new application layer handling, improving the configuration of local and distributed application layers.\n- Adjusted the `localColocatedClusterStack` to accept merged application layers, enhancing the flexibility of the local cluster setup.\n- Refactored extensions for shooter programs to support colocated local clusters, ensuring better integration and functionality.\n\nThis commit improves the architecture and usability of application layers within the cluster platform, facilitating better development practices.","tree":{"sha":"dc44a4593cc11354d7c9c2a6d65aeb01ae9e475c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/dc44a4593cc11354d7c9c2a6d65aeb01ae9e475c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/2b63dd6c5eab67996dc0dedea9b68f07e12c1e13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11413796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TGTGamer","id":11413796,"login":"TGTGamer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDEzNzk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip