.gift9475@alias.org.uk","name":"Jonathan S"},"message":"Refactor local socket layers for improved storage handling\n\n- Introduced a new `localClusterSocketLayer` function to replace direct usage of `NodeClusterSocket.layer` with `storage: \"local\"`, addressing issues with RPCs annotated with `ClusterSchema.Persisted`.\n- Updated `makeClusterLocalRunnerLayer` and `makeClusterLocalClientLayer` to utilize the new function, ensuring consistent in-memory storage for persisted RPCs.\n- Cleaned up imports in `platform.ts` and adjusted the application layers structure for better clarity and maintainability.\n\nThis commit enhances the handling of local socket layers and improves the overall architecture of the cluster platform.","tree":{"sha":"8bd474d5a5acd7f11334c716cc2e531908258acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/8bd474d5a5acd7f11334c716cc2e531908258acd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/a90241c931a613be4c184eab010fdf0226546ee5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11413796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TGTGamer","id":11413796,"login":"TGTGamer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDEzNzk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a