ile for the CI Monitor Subagent, detailing command structures for fetching CI status and updating self-healing fixes.\n- Created a dedicated TOML file for the CI Monitor Subagent, including developer instructions and command specifications to streamline CI operations.\n- Enabled multi-agent support in the configuration to enhance the functionality of the CI monitoring system.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOw2R1GUopWyn4HFyGzaJLu85cn\nNLOl6UK81riqa0nIoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOpsfBQ56U2S8VIt0cWb2DhafTMyyAE6+kXnJHprjoLscTYkuZN/WswDICIjNuS+UK\nBx+1AdjoJtRT0eGRqGbwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T00:07:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11413796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TGTGamer","id":11413796,"login":"TGTGamer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDEzNzk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Resnovas/Eventiva/commit/6219512f698c69c5d9a8d0cf8a0b5801c75781ba","node_id":"C_kwDOJX-7q9oAKDYyMTk1MTJmNjk4YzY5YzVkOWE4ZDBjZjhhMGI1ODAxYzc1NzgxYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Resnovas/Eventiva/commit/9c3a1097b91898a208761b0ba4d268d9f96629e