cess and usage.\n- Updated index.ts to integrate new layers and provide a unified interface for PostgreSQL database operations.\n- Enhanced platform default index to conditionally use PgDatabaseLayer based on environment settings.","tree":{"sha":"ac9e96dfee66b2d5ab9a89f50d2464c39b205548","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/ac9e96dfee66b2d5ab9a89f50d2464c39b205548"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/9c3a1097b91898a208761b0ba4d268d9f96629ef","verification":{"payload":"tree ac9e96dfee66b2d5ab9a89f50d2464c39b205548\nparent 84f10397a73d4ee9ed3dcd3fd3fa092c5aa1beb6\nauthor Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773792437 +0000\ncommitter Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773792437 +0000\n\nAdd PostgreSQL Database and Client Layers\n\n- Introduced a new PgClient layer for PostgreSQL, allowing configuration from environment variables for seamless integration.\n- Added PgDatabaseLayer utilizing Drizzle effect-postgres, enabling lazy initialization of the database from FinalTableStore.\n- Re-exported Drizzle ORM components in drizzle-pg.ts for easier access and usage.\n- Updated index.ts to integrate new layers and provide a unified interface for PostgreSQL database operations.\n- Enhanced platform default index to conditionally use PgDatabaseLayer based on environment settings.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOw2R1GUopWyn4HFyGzaJLu85cn\nNLOl6UK81riqa0nIoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKqnC6YvWYjYP3X5cnrGU2Yiib/yu+hjjqqE8TJn9Mgo2I3TtAv7Na1DgBwrl996sI\nwc/BwRVYpctwKGTd1/eAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T00:07:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11413796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/followers","following_url":"h