re infrastructure for Effect Vitest testing,\nincluding CI workflow updates, new devcontainers, documentation, and the\ncreation of a `*.spec.ts` file for every `src/*.ts` file across all\npackages. While the test files are created, a known module resolution\nissue for `@eventiva/*` imports in Vitest is currently blocking test\nexecution and will be addressed in subsequent work.\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-abdcf71a-a8c7-4020-ae77-a7bc285e6721\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-abdcf71a-a8c7-4020-ae77-a7bc285e6721\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c65493d221e87afc616a7d4798740517bffe4fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/9c65493d221e87afc616a7d4798740517bffe4fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/721054216b61baf1abe3731a49e0f454fb4f8b22","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c65493d221e87afc616a7d4798740517bffe4fc\nparent 986467a71a59a45d6260372e756b9f590086716a\nauthor Jonathan S <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773695852 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773695852 +0000\n\nEffect Vitest tests bootstrap (#681)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplement Effect Vitest TDD bootstrap, CI redesign, and create\nboilerplate test files for all source files to establish a comprehensive\ntesting framework.\n\nThis PR sets up the core infrastructure for Effect Vitest testing,\nincluding CI workflow updates, new devcontainers, documentation, and the\ncreation of a `*.spec.ts` file for every `src/*.ts` file across all\npackages. While the test files are created, a known module resolution\nissue for `@eventiva/*` imports in Vitest is currently blocking test\nexecution and will be addressed in subsequent work.\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-abdcf71a-a8c7-4020-ae77-a7bc285e6721\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-abdcf71a-a8c7-4020-ae77-a7bc285e6721\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuHNsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAy3cQAE2fWR025V6JtcAgbZFVzBEE\nv+zMU8yfh+qyF6twd27JMxLeYVv4S5/fJJfvRRwdErLFAb95TzWGFs7H3A1b1psm\nE9wdlq3a5UlxS1ExNFYCfQ51teXZovpvGd7gX8+APGDDnJeEUfRSJyANWG+YKLDt\nkRnZpxyw/toQTmfKT6z33EU8HFSxJ9r6vPlWkpRkIHJfrjM3jMnEoaG7bakfGGzH\nHArj4