":{"date":"2026-03-15T12:35:31Z","email":"jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan Stevens"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T12:35:31Z","email":"jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan Stevens"},"message":"Remove deprecated core library files and clean up the project structure\n\n- Deleted obsolete files including package.json, README.md, TypeScript declaration files, and various core components from the `@eventiva/core` package.\n- This cleanup is part of the effort to streamline the codebase and remove unused or outdated elements, preparing for future enhancements and refactoring.","tree":{"sha":"7bd35a9942f32aebaa2ac83490a1b2d9e55b6eb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/7bd35a9942f32aebaa2ac83490a1b2d9e55b6eb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/332cc476fa9f933aebafe8fd43197c6e2eb5d222","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bd35a9942f32aebaa2ac83490a1b2d9e55b6eb9\nparent 7c74650dfd689af0c967b00f9721c2a02b4879c6\nauthor Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773578131 +0000\ncommitter Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773578131 +0000\n\nRemove deprecated core library files and clean up the project structure\n\n- Deleted obsolete files including package.json, README.md, TypeScript declaration files, and various core components from the `@eventiva/core` package.\n- This cleanup is part of the effort to streamline the codebase and remove unused or outdated elements, preparing for future enhancements and refactoring.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOw2R1GUopWyn4HFyGzaJLu85cn\nNLOl6UK81riqa0nIoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQH7Aic0qW21fxLRSLRF1b3y5Ydz7KDSGxKaqkc6e2Ki4KcAqu3RFLB4iFmwm5sD3rk\n0KgJLD93xD+K7udumORQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-15T12:49:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon