s://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/commits/7c74650dfd689af0c967b00f9721c2a02b4879c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T23:10:54Z","email":"jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan S"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T23:10:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Configure module boundaries with tags and ESLint enforcement (#678)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nThis PR configures module boundaries for the Eventiva monorepo based on\nrelease groups and module types. It enforces dependency constraints\nusing Nx tags and ESLint rules with a **multi-tag system**.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Multi-Tag System\n\nProjects now use 2-3 tags:\n1. **Type tag** (required): `type:core`, `type:database`,\n`type:extension`, `type:platform`\n2. **Layer tag** (required): `layer:backend`, `layer:frontend`,\n`layer:shared`\n3. **Capability tags** (optional, multiple): `capability:entities`,\n`capability:workflows`, `capability:ui`\n\n### Module Type Tags\n- Added `type:core` tag to `@eventiva/core`\n- Added `type:database` tag to `@eventiva/databases.pg`\n- Added `type:extension` tag to extension packages\n- Added `type:platform` tag to platform packages\n\n### Layer Tags\n- Added `layer:backend` to all current packages\n- Structure ready for `layer:frontend` and `layer:shared` when needed\n\n### Capability Tags\n- Added `capability:entities` and `capability:workflows` to core and\nextensions that provide them\n\n### ESLint Configuration\n- Configured `@nx/enforce-module-boundaries` rule with:\n  - **Type-based constraints**: Enforce architectural boundaries\n  - **Layer-based constraints**: Enforce frontend/backend separation\n- Projects with multiple tags must satisfy ALL applicable constraints\n\n### Dependency Fixes\n- Moved `@eventiva/databases.pg` from `dependencies` to\n`devDependencies` in `@eventiva/extensions.contact` (extensions cannot\nhave runtime database dependencies, but can use types in dev)\n\n### GitHub Labels\n- Created `.github/config.json` for smartcloud to sync all tags (type,\nlayer, capability) as GitHub labels\n\n### Documentation\n- Added `docs/learnings/module-boundaries.md` with comprehensive\nmulti-tag documentation\n- Updated `docs/learnings/README.md` to include the new documentation\n\n### Cursor Integration\n- Created `.cursor/rules/module-boundaries.mdc` rule for persistent\ncontext\n- Created `.cursor/skills/module-boundaries/` skill for future use\n\n## Module Boundary Rules\n\n### Type-Based Rules\n\n| Source Type | Can Depend On |\n|------------|---------------|\n| `type:core` | (nothing) |\n| `type:database` | `type:core` |\n| `type:extension` | `type:core`, `type:extension` |\n| `type:platform` | `type:core`, `type:database`, `type:extension`,\n`type:platform` |\n\n### Layer-Based Rules\n\n| Source Layer | Can Depend On |\n|--------------|---------------|\n| `layer:backend` | `layer:backend`, `layer:shared` |\n| `layer:frontend` | `layer:frontend`, `layer:shared` |\n| `layer:shared` | `layer:shared` |\n\n**Important**: Projects with multiple tags must satisfy ALL applicable\nconstraints.\n\n## Example Tag Configurations\n\n**Backend Extension:**\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\"type:extension\", \"layer:backend\", \"capability:entities\", \"capability:workflows\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Frontend Component (future):**\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\"type:extension\", \"layer:frontend\", \"capability:ui\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Shared Types (future):**\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\"type:core\", \"layer:shared\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n- [ ] Run `pnpm nx lint` to verify ESLint rules are working\n- [ ] Verify all projects have correct tags\n- [ ] Check that smartcloud creates labels correctly\n\n## Related\n\n- Nx documentation:\nhttps://nx.dev/docs/features/enforce-module-boundaries\n- Learnings: `docs/learnings/module-boundaries.md`\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-97cb2615-9fca-43b1-84cb-486a2ab112d1\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-97cb2615-9fca-43b1-84cb-486a2ab112d1\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ba9dd30c013d3c2e36afbcc9193b0f2ae43667b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/5ba9dd30c013d3c2e36afbcc9193b0f2ae43667b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/7c74650dfd689af0c967b00f9721c2a02b4879c6","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ba9dd30c013d3c2e36afbcc9193b0f2ae43667b\nparent dd30f1031d59a3f9f2248c46e848841598fa8ee1\nauthor Jonathan S <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773529854 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773529854 +0000\n\nConfigure module boundaries with tags and ESLint enforcement (#678)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nThis PR configures module boundaries for the Eventiva monorepo based on\nrelease groups and module types. It enforces dependency constraints\nusing Nx tags and ESLint rules with a **multi-tag system**.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Multi-Tag System\n\nProjects now use 2-3 tags:\n1. **Type tag** (required): `type:core`, `type:database`,\n`type:extension`, `type:platform`\n2. **Layer tag** (required): `layer:backend`, `layer:frontend`,\n`layer:shared`\n3. **Capability tags** (optional, multiple): `capability:entities`,\n`capability:workflows`, `capability:ui`\n\n### Module Type Tags\n- Added `type:core` tag to `@eventiva/core`\n- Added `type:database` tag to `@eventiva/databases.pg`\n- Added `type:extension` tag to extension packages\n- Added `type:platform` tag to platform packages\n\n### Layer Tags\n- Added `layer:backend` to all current packages\n- Structure ready for `layer:frontend` and `layer:shared` when needed\n\n### Capability Tags\n- Added `capability:entities` and `capability:workflows` to core and\nextensions that provide them\n\n### ESLint Configuration\n- Configured `@nx/enforce-module-boundaries` rule with:\n  - **Type-based constraints**: Enforce architectural boundaries\n  - **Layer-based constraints**: Enforce frontend/backend separation\n- Projects with multiple tags must satisfy ALL applicable constraints\n\n### Dependency Fixes\n- Moved `@eventiva/databases.pg` from `dependencies` to\n`devDependencies` in `@eventiva/extensions.contact` (extensions cannot\nhave runtime database dependencies, but can use types in dev)\n\n### GitHub Labels\n- Created `.github/config.json` for smartcloud to sync all tags (type,\nlayer, capability) as GitHub labels\n\n### Documentation\n- Added `docs/learnings/module-boundaries.md` with comprehensive\nmulti-tag documentation\n- Updated `docs/learnings/README.md` to include the new documentation\n\n### Cursor Integration\n- Created `.cursor/rules/module-boundaries.mdc` rule for persistent\ncontext\n- Created `.cursor/skills/module-boundaries/` skill for future use\n\n## Module Boundary Rules\n\n### Type-Based Rules\n\n| Source Type | Can Depend On |\n|------------|---------------|\n| `type:core` | (nothing) |\n| `type:database` | `type:core` |\n| `type:extension` | `type:core`, `type:extension` |\n| `type:platform` | `type:core`, `type:database`, `type:extension`,\n`type:platform` |\n\n### Layer-Based Rules\n\n| Source Layer | Can Depend On |\n|--------------|---------------|\n| `layer:backend` | `layer:backend`, `layer:shared` |\n| `layer:frontend` | `layer:frontend`, `layer:shared` |\n| `layer:shared` | `layer:shared` |\n\n**Important**: Projects with multiple tags must satisfy ALL applicable\nconstraints.\n\n## Example Tag Configurations\n\n**Backend Extension:**\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\"type:extension\", \"layer:backend\", \"capability:entities\", \"capability:workflows\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Frontend Component (future):**\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\"type:extension\", \"layer:frontend\", \"capability:ui\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Shared Types (future):**\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\"type:core\", \"layer:shared\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n- [ ] Run `pnpm nx lint` to verify ESLint rules are working\n- [ ] Verify all projects have correct tags\n- [ ] Check that smartcloud creates labels correctly\n\n## Related\n\n- Nx documentation:\nhttps://nx.dev/docs/features/enforce-module-boundaries\n- Learnings: `docs/learnings/module-boundaries.md`\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-97cb2615-9fca-43b1-84cb-486a2ab112d1\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-97cb2615-9fca-43b1-84cb-486a2ab112d1\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpter+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaCsQAIVzj6p69gkdqQ5+LLiu6fHL\n99j5FMy08XBbV37khVQWRKGhUaquEFf1sabu235y7ZTFi279GOFLYn8qiqIBZGkE\nCOb7z9V2LEVrYz7xWGdjy7FTMbmRJDtgc93pt13gcFInnrza4BMKoDKfkfyTOF03\nS9otVyzzkJbAh54fuwH2NB1Sc236k1/RAXMyXjgIpDXflZeXvQJCQMZ8pXhuvM4A\nrdprKiUrguIT8xl6IcCN7kM3OrioWeqHzQbHnregUFYK+w6F/oBxfOMzTQbVYuy1\n5biw4OYsO9CJPspoLF/4w4G8nzmnufjpmBMvRFK24aWXn7SsCF1aifoVzYSAVlHP\nROBuxasHkbtc3NwzYVVCNC8YO1uwZTbf77JE3jRH8zUVDR22SFBibbsCTPCCNE79\nId9niLwMAsrPBJGnlAPB8kOHiHxLXOj9V6AyxdlVsoMtd66L4v5g2ps+LuvGoQOD\n3jAPrNTFJ5TXiB6ymLgC6ExNCFikDUxwldGG3IMcPNJCz2Q0eeukMLf7lcd+sMId\n7B3hyRMJRdFX4r9kb8az8tK2kLAYfpgMTofOp/5pF5krCjeI2Ld28bNmgdIQG5kj\npI79VSilBVfTB5UESgHxtrleBsw9FCxy/2jZ3U0m5KYtQpFBiSg3MhFFfoJFTwpM\nVnlZtViaYjZ465sLf28L\n=0EMh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-14T23:10:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://gi