 Stevens"},"message":"feat: update CodeRabbit configuration for enhanced review and integration features\n\nThis commit modifies the .coderabbit.yaml file to improve the review process by adding new placeholders for high-level summaries and auto titles, enabling auto assignment of reviewers, and enhancing the finishing touches section. Additionally, it updates the chat integrations to enable Linear and disable Jira, streamlining project management workflows.","tree":{"sha":"58318e6138b0979e23471600bf9be692555e0967","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/58318e6138b0979e23471600bf9be692555e0967"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/9c2145db407fa6321e16f0d3b8b201f3c7b89723","verification":{"payload":"tree 58318e6138b0979e23471600bf9be692555e0967\nparent 658631ef4d1b1bc945c69bd182432b5f8b621273\nauthor Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773356005 +0000\ncommitter Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773356005 +0000\n\nfeat: update CodeRabbit configuration for enhanced review and integration features\n\nThis commit modifies the .coderabbit.yaml file to improve the review process by adding new placeholders for high-level summaries and auto titles, enabling auto assignment of reviewers, and enhancing the finishing touches section. Additionally, it updates the chat integrations to enable Linear and disable Jira, streamlining project management workflows.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOw2R1GUopWyn4HFyGzaJLu85cn\nNLOl6UK81riqa0nIoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOXMu99zz+WIumS3DU93HtuKyUjnVvNvHrUWXjWtsncoz1BCZMLAZj1QiVQ6nu9cWQ\nQj/GTfK0lTHcwobRe/8AE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-12T22:53:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11413796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/events{/privacy}","followe