odeEnv`, `endpointsPort`, `integrityNonce`, and `encryptionKey`. Additionally, the `runtime-config.d.ts` and its source map are added to facilitate type definitions and improve developer experience.","tree":{"sha":"0e86dd41ba074d11656b26eb686a4a53cc369553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/0e86dd41ba074d11656b26eb686a4a53cc369553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/3f999aa40c8a0a38478bffb62dafe3991fd7fac6","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e86dd41ba074d11656b26eb686a4a53cc369553\nparent 48bb2aadea6d2f4fcd840153284736144dea7584\nauthor Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773272381 +0000\ncommitter Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773272381 +0000\n\nfeat: add runtime configuration interface and implementation\n\nThis commit introduces a new `RuntimeConfig` interface and its live implementation, allowing for the loading of runtime configuration from environment variables. The new configuration includes properties such as `nodeEnv`, `endpointsPort`, `integrityNonce`, and `encryptionKey`. Additionally, the `runtime-config.d.ts` and its source map are added to facilitate type definitions and improve developer experience.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOw2R1GUopWyn4HFyGzaJLu85cn\nNLOl6UK81riqa0nIoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAroSBAj2iIGTn1yccZR9iCeEQCLJ9o4DmUJ+guX+FfZAGgQO5w9dUOxVSLHZ0Nami\njr04syC29VBXga5mkTKQ0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-11T23:39:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11413796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_