subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TGTGamer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/commits/48bb2aadea6d2f4fcd840153284736144dea7584/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T23:39:10Z","email":"jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan Stevens"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T23:39:10Z","email":"jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com","name":"Jonathan Stevens"},"message":"feat: implement Drizzle Effect-Postgres integration plan\n\nThis commit introduces a comprehensive plan for integrating Drizzle Effect with Postgres, including the establishment of a full relationship system (m2m, o2m, m2o, o2o) and enhancements to the entity schema. Key tasks include extending FinalTableStore for relation metadata, building relation fields during entity schema construction, and implementing a pluggable database extension via registerDB(). The plan also outlines improvements for foreign key resolution and CRUD handler customization, ensuring observability throughout the integration process.","tree":{"sha":"d4dd25da4b039ed696009b2dce1d9bac79837d15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/trees/d4dd25da4b039ed696009b2dce1d9bac79837d15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Resnovas/Eventiva/git/commits/48bb2aadea6d2f4fcd840153284736144dea7584","verification":{"payload":"tree d4dd25da4b039ed696009b2dce1d9bac79837d15\nparent 4941e7f7db8cd3af136fac7ea7f85310c469a6d4\nauthor Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773272350 +0000\ncommitter Jonathan Stevens <jonathan.stevens@resnovas.com> 1773272350 +0000\n\nfeat: implement Drizzle Effect-Postgres integration plan\n\nThis commit introduces a comprehensive plan for integrating Drizzle Effect with Postgres, including the establishment of a full relationship system (m2m, o2m, m2o, o2o) and enhancements to the entity schema. Key tasks include extending FinalTableStore for relation metadata, building relation fie